              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 1:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwa amba Jehova. Amubone! Aboneka maenzi aazwa kunyika, ayooba mulonga wazambangulwe, ayoovumba nyika azyoonse zili mulinjiyo, munzi abantu bakede mumonya. Elyo bantu bayoolila, aboonse bakede mucisi bayoowuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
